WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:09.670
Explosive Shoot

00:00:16.490 --> 00:00:19.810
Keep fighting chasing your dream

00:00:19.810 --> 00:00:23.140
with love, courage and friendship

00:00:23.140 --> 00:00:26.640
This Blade and I are one

00:00:26.640 --> 00:00:29.680
Spin as hard as you can until the limit

00:00:29.680 --> 00:00:32.780
BURNING SOUL

00:00:43.710 --> 00:00:46.200
The things I can't do alone

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:50.140
are not impossible if you're with me

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:52.960
Come with me

00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:56.280
to the ends of this world

00:00:58.070 --> 00:01:03.540
The Four Sacred Beasts are athletes of love

00:01:04.330 --> 00:01:07.100
Shine! Open your eyes!

00:01:07.100 --> 00:01:09.730
Dragoon  Dranzer  Draciel  Driger

00:01:09.730 --> 00:01:12.450
Awaken!

00:01:12.790 --> 00:01:16.060
Fly across the sky, my energy

00:01:16.060 --> 00:01:19.380
Rise up, Sacred Beast!

00:01:19.380 --> 00:01:22.830
To defeat all the enemies who stand in our way

00:01:22.830 --> 00:01:26.050
jump, bearing everyone's hopes

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:29.080
SHINING SOUL

00:01:44.590 --> 00:01:45.250
Takao!

00:01:46.600 --> 00:01:47.860
Are you okay?

00:01:48.240 --> 00:01:49.210
Hurting anywhere?

00:01:49.470 --> 00:01:50.520
Takao...

00:01:50.780 --> 00:01:52.000
I'm good.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:54.980
<i>Sorry</i>. If only I didn't get hurt...

00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:59.100
Don't sweat it. You got hurt protecting us.

00:01:59.690 --> 00:02:00.670
Let's swap out.

00:02:00.670 --> 00:02:02.780
You carried him earlier, right?

00:02:02.780 --> 00:02:03.760
Then I'll—

00:02:03.760 --> 00:02:05.100
I'm good, I said!

00:02:07.130 --> 00:02:09.800
Sorry, but I can still keep going.

00:02:14.310 --> 00:02:16.790
He's so set in his ways...

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:18.850
All due to anger

00:02:18.850 --> 00:02:21.090
for what they've done to Max...

00:02:21.390 --> 00:02:22.740
Even I...

00:02:24.780 --> 00:02:25.540
What's that?

00:02:26.220 --> 00:02:27.840
Takao!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:32.380
It's a car! A car!

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.890
Heeey!

00:02:41.160 --> 00:02:43.270
Excuse me, could you please give us a ride?

00:02:45.410 --> 00:02:46.610
Hey, guys!

00:02:46.610 --> 00:02:47.280
Olivier?!

00:02:47.920 --> 00:02:49.260
It's been a while.

00:02:49.260 --> 00:02:50.120
Giancarlo!

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:52.490
What brings you two out here?

00:02:54.450 --> 00:02:55.980
It's you!

00:02:55.980 --> 00:03:01.040
Reunion With The Euro Team!

00:03:05.310 --> 00:03:07.010
How refreshing.

00:03:07.500 --> 00:03:11.040
I thought we'd freeze before
we even got to the Tournament.

00:03:11.220 --> 00:03:14.500
How many more kilometers
until we reach the Tournament's grounds?

00:03:14.680 --> 00:03:16.580
Jeez, what a surprise!

00:03:16.740 --> 00:03:19.010
We came to see the World Championships.

00:03:19.360 --> 00:03:22.190
To think we'd pick you up along the way...

00:03:22.190 --> 00:03:23.770
You really saved us.

00:03:23.990 --> 00:03:29.650
If not for us, you all would
have frozen out here in the tundra!

00:03:29.650 --> 00:03:31.780
You best thank us from the bottom of your hearts!

00:03:32.040 --> 00:03:35.120
He's as vain as ever, huh?

00:03:35.870 --> 00:03:38.970
That takes me back...
back to our match with you guys.

00:03:39.780 --> 00:03:41.140
Unicolyon!

00:03:42.150 --> 00:03:43.600
Amphisbaena!

00:03:45.440 --> 00:03:46.250
Salamalyon!

00:03:48.240 --> 00:03:49.570
Go, Griffolyon!

00:03:50.350 --> 00:03:54.290
I don't think your saving us is any coincidence.

00:03:56.010 --> 00:03:59.260
That reminds me... Are Ralf and Johnny not present?

00:03:59.560 --> 00:04:01.220
They had other plans for the day.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.520
They still dislike company, then?

00:04:05.760 --> 00:04:07.240
More or less.

00:04:07.320 --> 00:04:09.920
But man, you guys have it rough.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:11.990
Getting attacked out here like that...

00:04:12.190 --> 00:04:13.080
Yeah.

00:04:13.360 --> 00:04:15.900
Borg is unbelievable.

00:04:15.900 --> 00:04:18.230
A sudden attack from a helicopter.

00:04:18.230 --> 00:04:20.600
And then an unsolicited Beybattle.

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:22.620
If Max hadn't battled them,

00:04:22.630 --> 00:04:24.950
what would have happened to us?

00:04:25.100 --> 00:04:27.590
Well, it wasn't so easy for me.

00:04:27.590 --> 00:04:28.440
Max...

00:04:28.690 --> 00:04:30.630
I tried my best, but I lost.

00:04:30.630 --> 00:04:33.190
And on top of that, they stole my Sacred Beast...

00:04:33.190 --> 00:04:34.250
It's heart-wrenching.

00:04:34.560 --> 00:04:36.520
I'll get you payback.

00:04:36.520 --> 00:04:38.500
I'll defeat Borg. You can count on that.

00:04:39.090 --> 00:04:41.210
I won't let them get away with this!

00:04:41.210 --> 00:04:45.220
I'll give them a piece of my mind in the Finals!

00:04:46.330 --> 00:04:47.240
Takao.

00:04:47.810 --> 00:04:50.170
I understand your frustration with Borg.

00:04:50.170 --> 00:04:51.000
However...

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:54.040
I don't think you can beat them with anger alone.

00:04:54.440 --> 00:04:55.530
What'd you say..?

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:00.570
What's that supposed to mean? Huh?!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:11.620
Has the bus stopped?

00:05:12.910 --> 00:05:15.620
We seem to be having trouble with the engine.

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:18.120
Are we going to have to walk again?

00:05:18.120 --> 00:05:21.010
No, I don't think it's something
you need concern yourself with.

00:05:22.710 --> 00:05:27.010
Get off the bus and take a breather.
We've got a long trip ahead of us.

00:05:28.110 --> 00:05:29.600
Can't help it, I suppose.

00:05:31.760 --> 00:05:33.220
This is not good!

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.020
What's the matter, Dad?

00:05:35.360 --> 00:05:37.070
Not good? You don't mean...

00:05:37.070 --> 00:05:38.990
we're being attacked by Borg again?!

00:05:39.460 --> 00:05:40.430
Dad!

00:05:40.430 --> 00:05:41.490
I can't hold it!

00:05:41.570 --> 00:05:43.100
I need to pee!

00:05:43.750 --> 00:05:46.450
Gosh, does it ever end?

00:05:46.450 --> 00:05:49.460
Maybe getting a breath of fresh air
<i>would</i> be a good change of pace?

00:05:49.690 --> 00:05:50.960
Agreed!

00:05:51.160 --> 00:05:53.460
I'll let you know when we can get moving again.

00:05:53.680 --> 00:05:54.660
Come on, Takao.

00:05:54.920 --> 00:05:55.470
Yeah.

00:05:55.810 --> 00:05:57.560
Mind if we tag along?

00:05:57.560 --> 00:05:57.970
Sure.

00:06:01.680 --> 00:06:03.530
Where are we?

00:06:05.510 --> 00:06:07.650
It's kind of creepy.

00:06:07.900 --> 00:06:10.720
Perhaps we should have stayed on the bus...

00:06:10.720 --> 00:06:12.810
I think it looks fascinating.

00:06:12.900 --> 00:06:13.870
Huh?

00:06:13.870 --> 00:06:16.220
Let's take a look inside, boys.

00:06:16.480 --> 00:06:18.110
Chairman Daitenji?

00:06:18.540 --> 00:06:20.820
Don't go!

00:06:21.740 --> 00:06:23.700
Let's go on in, too.

00:06:26.800 --> 00:06:28.400
Imperial ruins...

00:06:28.840 --> 00:06:32.480
I imagine Russian nobles lived here at some point.

00:06:34.980 --> 00:06:35.770
Not good.

00:06:36.040 --> 00:06:36.970
This is not good!

00:06:36.970 --> 00:06:38.710
Again, grandpa?

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.500
Do you have to go number two this time?

00:06:40.700 --> 00:06:41.700
No!

00:06:42.410 --> 00:06:43.970
Can you not feel it?

00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:47.020
This bloodthirst is all too familiar...

00:06:55.930 --> 00:06:56.830
What?!

00:06:56.830 --> 00:06:58.140
It's been a while!

00:06:58.140 --> 00:06:58.700
Who's there?

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:04.980
It's...

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:07.980
Ralf!

00:07:08.200 --> 00:07:10.700
What are you doing here?

00:07:10.700 --> 00:07:12.720
Don't scare us like that!

00:07:13.330 --> 00:07:16.710
It's clear to me that Borg bested you.

00:07:16.880 --> 00:07:18.210
How do you--

00:07:18.480 --> 00:07:19.540
Furthermore,

00:07:19.540 --> 00:07:22.230
Max didn't even put up a fight.

00:07:22.530 --> 00:07:24.760
Following suit, he lost his Sacred Beast.

00:07:24.850 --> 00:07:25.870
Unbelievable.

00:07:26.930 --> 00:07:28.170
What'd you say?

00:07:28.170 --> 00:07:30.100
Do you really wanna go?

00:07:30.420 --> 00:07:32.110
What if I do?

00:07:32.110 --> 00:07:33.100
What?!

00:07:33.530 --> 00:07:36.480
Let me tell you why I've come all the way here.

00:07:36.830 --> 00:07:39.670
It's to completely and utterly crush you!

00:07:39.830 --> 00:07:41.990
Ralf, are you serious?

00:07:42.240 --> 00:07:43.680
Of course I am.

00:07:44.000 --> 00:07:46.200
I wouldn't come this far as a prank.

00:07:46.360 --> 00:07:49.650
We're focusing on our upcoming
match against the Russian Team.

00:07:50.080 --> 00:07:52.510
This is neither the time nor place!

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.200
You're gonna fight us, no matter what!

00:07:54.410 --> 00:07:56.710
Johnny! What's the meaning of this?

00:07:56.710 --> 00:07:58.080
Giancarlo! Olivier!

00:07:58.420 --> 00:07:59.890
What are you...

00:08:00.200 --> 00:08:01.510
I get it.

00:08:01.510 --> 00:08:03.490
Saving us on the road,

00:08:03.830 --> 00:08:05.870
then the car breaking down here...

00:08:05.870 --> 00:08:09.480
they're no coincidences. All in order to challenge us, huh?

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:10.780
Precisely.

00:08:11.170 --> 00:08:13.460
All of this is our doing.

00:08:13.750 --> 00:08:15.820
Why are you doing this, exactly?

00:08:15.820 --> 00:08:19.240
I thought we were on pretty good terms after battling.

00:08:19.460 --> 00:08:22.000
On pretty good terms?

00:08:23.420 --> 00:08:24.730
What's so funny?

00:08:25.070 --> 00:08:27.430
You never stop with your childish prattling.

00:08:27.610 --> 00:08:28.650
Like we said...

00:08:28.650 --> 00:08:30.700
Spare me of your delusions!

00:08:31.020 --> 00:08:32.240
Delusions?

00:08:32.450 --> 00:08:36.040
Now that you've messed with the Russian Team,

00:08:36.320 --> 00:08:39.790
don't you think you'll meet the same fate as Max?

00:08:40.100 --> 00:08:44.460
Our pride won't allow us to let you into the Finals

00:08:44.700 --> 00:08:47.260
as the representatives of the World.

00:08:47.650 --> 00:08:49.360
<i>That</i> is why we will...

00:08:50.470 --> 00:08:51.310
crush you!

00:08:51.530 --> 00:08:54.180
Takao, you're up first!

00:08:54.360 --> 00:08:55.940
This is insane!

00:08:55.940 --> 00:08:59.740
Why do you have to go out of your way to destroy us?!

00:09:00.410 --> 00:09:02.190
Count me in.

00:09:02.370 --> 00:09:03.370
Takao?!

00:09:03.370 --> 00:09:04.610
What's gotten into you?

00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:08.950
I can't stand around and let them talk down to Max!

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:10.520
If you want to crush us...

00:09:10.890 --> 00:09:13.290
then let's see you try!

00:09:13.460 --> 00:09:15.410
It would be my pleasure!

00:09:25.930 --> 00:09:27.590
Making fun of me...

00:09:27.590 --> 00:09:29.280
I'll bring you down!

00:09:29.890 --> 00:09:30.800
Seiryuu!

00:09:33.110 --> 00:09:34.010
Insolent.

00:09:34.010 --> 00:09:36.210
In your current state, you don't stand a chance.

00:09:36.600 --> 00:09:37.880
Griffolyon!

00:09:40.020 --> 00:09:41.430
Go!!

00:09:47.100 --> 00:09:47.900
What?!

00:09:48.090 --> 00:09:49.410
Is that all, Takao?

00:09:49.410 --> 00:09:51.180
I'll show you how it's done!

00:09:51.730 --> 00:09:52.640
Wing Dagger!

00:09:58.610 --> 00:09:59.610
Weak.

00:09:59.610 --> 00:10:00.780
Far too weak!

00:10:01.080 --> 00:10:03.000
Is this everything you've got?

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:04.640
Takao..!

00:10:04.640 --> 00:10:06.130
You can do it!

00:10:06.460 --> 00:10:07.710
Why you...

00:10:08.060 --> 00:10:09.710
Don't make a fool out of me!

00:10:15.970 --> 00:10:17.560
What's wrong, Takao?

00:10:17.560 --> 00:10:19.280
Can you even call this a battle

00:10:19.280 --> 00:10:21.220
if you get so hotheaded?

00:10:21.440 --> 00:10:22.760
Zip it!

00:10:22.760 --> 00:10:24.480
Mind your own business!

00:10:27.980 --> 00:10:29.200
Darn...

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:30.560
This is bad.

00:10:30.560 --> 00:10:31.820
If this keeps up, Takao will...

00:10:34.430 --> 00:10:35.560
Chairman...

00:10:35.560 --> 00:10:36.740
Don't.

00:10:36.740 --> 00:10:40.460
This is a no-holds-barred battle between Takao and Ralf.

00:10:40.460 --> 00:10:41.250
But..!

00:10:42.530 --> 00:10:44.790
He's just dodging me...

00:10:44.980 --> 00:10:46.620
Ram right into him, Dragoon!

00:10:52.250 --> 00:10:53.480
You've got to be kidding...

00:10:55.460 --> 00:10:57.190
Your Bey is unscathed.

00:10:57.190 --> 00:10:58.680
I let you off the hook.

00:10:58.680 --> 00:10:59.390
What?!

00:10:59.580 --> 00:11:01.980
Now take your Bey once more!

00:11:01.980 --> 00:11:03.160
Like I said,

00:11:03.160 --> 00:11:05.060
I will completely and utterly crush you.

00:11:20.310 --> 00:11:21.490
What's the matter, Takao?

00:11:21.890 --> 00:11:23.400
Already finished?

00:11:24.660 --> 00:11:26.840
Of course not!

00:11:27.120 --> 00:11:28.410
Bring it, Ralf!

00:11:28.410 --> 00:11:29.950
We'll continue our battle.

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:31.740
This time I <i>will</i> beat you!

00:11:31.990 --> 00:11:34.090
And go to the finals!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:39.350
Go, Takao!

00:11:39.350 --> 00:11:42.390
This time, show him just what you're made of!

00:11:42.770 --> 00:11:45.560
Something's off... I have a bad feeling about this.

00:11:45.560 --> 00:11:49.150
I feel like Takao can't win like this.

00:11:49.290 --> 00:11:50.740
Ready?!

00:11:51.040 --> 00:11:53.740
Three! Two! One!

00:11:54.010 --> 00:11:55.730
Go Shoot!

00:12:09.540 --> 00:12:11.740
I'll win this time!

00:12:11.920 --> 00:12:13.210
If I don't...

00:12:17.940 --> 00:12:19.770
Go, Dragoon!

00:12:25.470 --> 00:12:27.010
Dragoon's pushing him back!

00:12:27.010 --> 00:12:28.860
You can do this, Takao!

00:12:29.330 --> 00:12:31.860
Phantom Hurricane!

00:12:34.100 --> 00:12:35.310
Griffolyon!

00:12:40.190 --> 00:12:42.150
Is that the full extent of your rage?

00:12:42.150 --> 00:12:42.840
No way!

00:12:45.680 --> 00:12:48.160
Dragoon's being pushed back!

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:48.800
He's tough!

00:12:49.040 --> 00:12:51.580
I have to beat Borg!

00:12:51.840 --> 00:12:54.580
I can't lose now!

00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:56.440
Not here..!

00:12:56.440 --> 00:12:57.680
Seiryu!

00:13:05.420 --> 00:13:07.180
He stopped it again!

00:13:07.400 --> 00:13:09.130
How? How?!

00:13:09.320 --> 00:13:10.520
You fool.

00:13:10.520 --> 00:13:11.560
What?!

00:13:11.560 --> 00:13:15.310
You can't win a battle with rage alone.

00:13:15.310 --> 00:13:16.590
Shut up!

00:13:16.590 --> 00:13:18.440
Seiryuu! Push him back!

00:13:26.120 --> 00:13:27.360
Don't you get it?

00:13:27.360 --> 00:13:28.170
What?!

00:13:28.330 --> 00:13:31.250
You have something stronger than anger,

00:13:31.250 --> 00:13:34.330
a power which only the BBA possesses.

00:13:34.330 --> 00:13:36.430
A power that only we have?

00:13:36.430 --> 00:13:38.570
If you can't acknowledge that,

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:40.240
there'll be no end to your foolishness.

00:13:40.240 --> 00:13:42.540
As such, my only option is to destroy you!

00:13:42.540 --> 00:13:43.830
Shut it!

00:13:43.900 --> 00:13:45.400
Get up, Seiryuu!

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:50.220
Wing Dagger!

00:13:57.340 --> 00:13:58.800
What's wrong, Seiryuu?

00:13:58.800 --> 00:13:59.920
You can't get worn out now!

00:13:59.920 --> 00:14:01.450
We're not done yet!

00:14:02.180 --> 00:14:04.130
This is far too one-sided!

00:14:04.630 --> 00:14:06.410
Griffolyon's power...

00:14:06.540 --> 00:14:08.630
It seems to be even stronger than before.

00:14:08.870 --> 00:14:12.210
We might not even make it to the Finals at this rate!

00:14:12.530 --> 00:14:15.660
Ralf has a point, too.

00:14:15.660 --> 00:14:18.270
He's right. You can't fight with anger alone.

00:14:19.040 --> 00:14:24.750
Takao's just making Seiryuu
to rush right in with his anger.

00:14:24.890 --> 00:14:27.880
That's only going to hurt Seiryuu!

00:14:27.880 --> 00:14:32.350
Then what's the power
that Ralf said only we have?

00:14:32.750 --> 00:14:34.710
A power only we have--

00:14:34.710 --> 00:14:39.570
A power that has carried
us through so many battles...

00:14:44.600 --> 00:14:48.500
It all ends here, Takao. Time to put an end to this.

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:50.450
Darn it...

00:14:50.690 --> 00:14:51.700
Griffolyon!

00:14:55.410 --> 00:14:57.900
Takao! Remember Germany!

00:14:57.900 --> 00:14:58.310
Huh?

00:14:58.640 --> 00:15:00.740
Your last match with Ralf!

00:15:00.740 --> 00:15:02.680
Remember that battle!

00:15:03.110 --> 00:15:04.660
My battle with Ralf...

00:15:08.750 --> 00:15:11.240
Right... back then...

00:15:11.350 --> 00:15:13.360
I tried to protect Seiryuu.

00:15:13.640 --> 00:15:14.260
Seiryuu...

00:15:23.890 --> 00:15:25.860
Seiryuu!!

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.880
That light...

00:15:46.890 --> 00:15:48.990
Right... I get it now!

00:15:49.220 --> 00:15:52.890
I hurt Seiryuu by not thinking things through.

00:15:53.090 --> 00:15:55.280
It's the complete opposite of how I was in Germany.

00:15:55.440 --> 00:15:57.420
I was consumed by anger,

00:15:57.420 --> 00:15:59.750
and worked Seiryuu too hard.

00:15:59.840 --> 00:16:02.160
But... I won't stand for that!

00:16:02.390 --> 00:16:06.030
I have to value my friend, Seiryuu—my Sacred Beast!

00:16:07.270 --> 00:16:10.370
There's no way we can't fight a serious battle!

00:16:10.580 --> 00:16:12.380
<i>Yes</i>, Takao!

00:16:12.690 --> 00:16:13.630
Now, then!

00:16:13.630 --> 00:16:15.420
Our real battle can begin!

00:16:15.760 --> 00:16:16.970
Fine by me.

00:16:16.970 --> 00:16:18.370
Wing Dagger!

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:28.740
It's so powerful.

00:16:28.740 --> 00:16:30.290
What's that light?

00:16:30.290 --> 00:16:35.540
Takao is surpassing the limits
of his Bey and his Sacred Beast.

00:16:35.610 --> 00:16:38.670
A strong light originating from
your belief in your friends.

00:16:38.670 --> 00:16:42.390
<i>That's</i> the power only you have.
One of passionate friendship.

00:16:42.390 --> 00:16:45.440
It's your one shot at defeating Borg.

00:16:45.780 --> 00:16:46.930
Sacred Beasts...

00:16:46.930 --> 00:16:47.990
Beys...

00:16:47.990 --> 00:16:49.300
The BBA!

00:16:49.300 --> 00:16:52.320
For those friends...
<i>with</i> those friends!

00:16:52.520 --> 00:16:55.210
I will go to...

00:16:55.210 --> 00:16:55.780
the Finals!

00:16:56.160 --> 00:16:57.560
Here we go, Seiryuu!

00:17:00.510 --> 00:17:01.490
Griffolyon!

00:17:13.220 --> 00:17:14.430
Hey, Ralf!

00:17:14.430 --> 00:17:15.920
I won!

00:17:15.920 --> 00:17:17.110
No complaints, right?

00:17:17.460 --> 00:17:19.400
Indeed. I'm satisfied.

00:17:19.680 --> 00:17:21.280
You're "satisfied"..?

00:17:21.280 --> 00:17:23.100
What's with that attitude?!

00:17:23.100 --> 00:17:24.380
Get over yourself!

00:17:24.580 --> 00:17:28.090
Do you know what you made me go through?

00:17:28.270 --> 00:17:29.830
I'm gonna smack you!

00:17:29.830 --> 00:17:30.900
Wait, Takao!

00:17:30.900 --> 00:17:32.380
What, Max?

00:17:32.380 --> 00:17:33.710
You guys...

00:17:33.710 --> 00:17:36.790
Did you do all this to help us realize that

00:17:36.790 --> 00:17:39.420
we're the only ones that possess this power?

00:17:39.640 --> 00:17:43.690
Ralf was pushing Takao's buttons the whole battle.

00:17:43.690 --> 00:17:47.560
But at the same time, it almost
seemed like he was giving him advice.

00:17:47.560 --> 00:17:51.640
And their earlier malice has completely vanished.

00:17:52.580 --> 00:17:54.370
F-For real?

00:17:54.370 --> 00:17:55.640
What's your game?

00:17:56.840 --> 00:17:58.680
You guessed it.

00:18:00.940 --> 00:18:03.900
Why the act?

00:18:04.210 --> 00:18:09.340
You lot—especially Takao—aren't
the type to hear others out, yeah?

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.730
Borg, your next opponent,

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.920
is a truly fearsome enemy!

00:18:14.560 --> 00:18:16.510
And they aren't just strong.

00:18:16.510 --> 00:18:19.920
They're special Bladers.
Sacred Beast hunters, if you will.

00:18:20.340 --> 00:18:23.580
They've been trained to take Sacred Beasts.

00:18:23.920 --> 00:18:27.650
When it comes to technique,
we're far ahead of you guys.

00:18:27.650 --> 00:18:30.320
But that alone wouldn't beat them.

00:18:30.500 --> 00:18:32.940
So we had to show you, no matter what it took.

00:18:32.940 --> 00:18:36.100
A power that Borg does not have. Only you do.

00:18:36.370 --> 00:18:39.080
The ones who can put a stop to Borg's plans

00:18:39.080 --> 00:18:41.600
are you, the ones entered into the Finals.

00:18:41.840 --> 00:18:44.880
Well, Takao? Still want to smack him?

00:18:45.140 --> 00:18:47.980
Tch. I lost all motivation.

00:18:48.540 --> 00:18:50.000
But hey,

00:18:50.090 --> 00:18:52.450
even if it was a little rough,

00:18:52.450 --> 00:18:54.190
my eyes were opened, thanks to you.

00:18:54.190 --> 00:18:54.940
Thanks.

00:18:55.180 --> 00:18:55.870
Yes.

00:18:56.120 --> 00:18:57.660
My apologies.

00:18:57.660 --> 00:18:59.680
What a relief.

00:18:59.680 --> 00:19:01.430
Takao didn't hit him...

00:19:01.430 --> 00:19:05.420
A favor wouldn't be worth getting hit over.

00:19:05.740 --> 00:19:07.260
A favor?

00:19:07.260 --> 00:19:07.930
From who?

00:19:08.040 --> 00:19:10.130
Monsieur Daitenji over there.

00:19:14.420 --> 00:19:16.650
We got in contact on our way to the Tournament.

00:19:17.730 --> 00:19:20.730
After the bus broke down from Borg's attack,

00:19:20.730 --> 00:19:24.030
Takao was especially lost in anger.

00:19:24.030 --> 00:19:26.960
I was worried you'd fight Borg like that,

00:19:26.960 --> 00:19:30.710
so I thought Ralf and the others
could give you a wake up call.

00:19:34.560 --> 00:19:36.940
Don't "ho ho" us!

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:39.390
Both back in Europe and now,

00:19:39.390 --> 00:19:41.490
your methods are in bad taste!

00:19:41.490 --> 00:19:42.200
Gosh!

00:19:42.650 --> 00:19:44.580
My bad, my bad.

00:19:44.580 --> 00:19:48.970
I didn't think they would take it so seriously.

00:19:49.270 --> 00:19:52.540
What you've learned today is indeed powerful.

00:19:52.540 --> 00:19:54.340
Even so, your opponent is Borg.

00:19:54.780 --> 00:19:56.660
There's no guarantee you'll win.

00:19:56.970 --> 00:20:00.560
But that's your one hope for victory!

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:02.110
Not only Takao,

00:20:02.110 --> 00:20:05.190
but Rei and Kai should learn to use this power as well.

00:20:05.450 --> 00:20:06.900
Leave it to us!

00:20:06.900 --> 00:20:08.610
We'll learn how to use it!

00:20:08.900 --> 00:20:10.790
Believe in friends, huh?

00:20:10.790 --> 00:20:12.900
That's a tall order,

00:20:13.040 --> 00:20:15.600
but if that's what it takes to win...

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:17.000
Takao.

00:20:17.000 --> 00:20:21.440
Don't put your European friends' advice to waste.

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.370
Yeah.

00:20:22.370 --> 00:20:23.370
I know.

00:20:26.450 --> 00:20:27.430
Ralf.

00:20:27.430 --> 00:20:28.400
Johnny.

00:20:28.400 --> 00:20:29.370
Olivier.

00:20:29.370 --> 00:20:30.260
Giancarlo.

00:20:31.170 --> 00:20:32.790
And you guys, too!

00:20:32.790 --> 00:20:35.490
Promise me that in the finals,

00:20:35.490 --> 00:20:38.860
that we won't let Borg do as they please!

00:20:50.010 --> 00:20:51.740
Welcome.

00:20:53.280 --> 00:20:55.230
That's the Tournament grounds for the Finals?

00:20:55.670 --> 00:20:56.340
Yes sir.

00:20:56.340 --> 00:21:01.370
Everything from head to toe was
constructed by Borg's scientists.

00:21:01.370 --> 00:21:01.760
Good.

00:21:02.320 --> 00:21:03.840
You four.

00:21:03.840 --> 00:21:07.180
You must crush the BBA, no matter what.

00:21:07.180 --> 00:21:07.750
Am I clear?

00:21:07.920 --> 00:21:09.450
You have our word.

00:21:09.450 --> 00:21:12.820
We should have no trouble
taking care of such weak opponents.

00:21:12.820 --> 00:21:16.400
We have already captured
one of their Sacred Beasts.

00:21:16.400 --> 00:21:19.510
Those remaining will soon belong to you, Sir.

00:21:19.760 --> 00:21:22.170
The World Championship finals...

00:21:22.170 --> 00:21:24.940
The Sacred beasts will fall into my grasp.

00:21:24.940 --> 00:21:27.510
Just a little longer until my dream comes true.

00:21:39.960 --> 00:21:44.720
Spring waves its hand smiling,

00:21:44.720 --> 00:21:50.200
Summer spreads passion.

00:21:50.200 --> 00:21:55.350
Seasons pass one after the other,

00:21:55.350 --> 00:21:59.560
Fall and Winter are good friends.

00:22:01.000 --> 00:22:05.660
When there is a problem you can't solve,

00:22:05.660 --> 00:22:11.560
Trust, friendship, love and emotion

00:22:14.120 --> 00:22:18.800
Clouds keep flying across the sky,

00:22:18.800 --> 00:22:24.200
the sky keeps changing every second

00:22:24.200 --> 00:22:29.090
My eyes well up and tears stream down my face,

00:22:29.090 --> 00:22:33.090
but they're not tears of sadness

00:22:34.820 --> 00:22:39.420
I summon my courage and try to put it into words.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.770
"Let's go on a journey to the city of hope!"

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:49.760
All your dreams will come true

00:22:57.920 --> 00:23:02.010
According to my analysis,
the World Championship Finals will finally begin!

00:23:02.360 --> 00:23:04.920
The first match will be Kai vs Sergey.

00:23:05.230 --> 00:23:10.200
Oh my! Soichirou Hiwatari's
appearance and voice just scream "villain"!

00:23:10.280 --> 00:23:12.140
He handed something to Kai!

00:23:12.700 --> 00:23:15.520
Is that Black Dranzer's Bit?!

00:23:15.770 --> 00:23:17.860
Kai, are you..?!

00:23:18.390 --> 00:23:20.630
Next time: Kai's Decision!

00:23:20.710 --> 00:23:24.330
Oh no! Does blood run thicker than friendship?
